   * // ...
   * constants: {
   * 1300: 2.0,  // "gain"
   * depth: -1,  // "depth"
   * }
   * }
   * ```
   * Corresponding JavaScript code, overriding all constants:
   * ```js
   * {
   * // ...
   * constants: {
   * 0: false,   // "has_point_light"
   * 1200: 3.0,  // "specular_param"
   * 1300: 2.0,  // "gain"
   * width: 20,  // "width"
   * depth: -1,  // "depth"
   * height: 15, // "height"
   * }
   * }
   * ```
   * </div>
   */
